  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-defense art direction, disciplined cyan/red palette, clear desktop hierarchy, and consistent controls/results styling across viewports. However, tablet/mobile become excessively tall and visually repetitive; dense all-caps microcopy, evidence labels, and footer text are uncomfortably tiny. The mobile header feels clipped and incomplete, while the tablet header visibly truncates navigation. Desktop also carries excessive empty space above the primary panel.",
